 "text": "Hi, how you doing these days? You could try going to bed an hour earlier each night this week, even if it' just for three days. I' found hand digging with a tool works well. The water and bruise method is cheapest, but the smoky smell might make your neighbours mad. The burner is fastest but costs more than the job. Hand digging with a tool is the best you' ever do. Not pointless, it' good way to clear a small drive. Just do it for an hour or two, once a week on calm days.",
